  "description": "<h2 data-start=\"42\" data-end=\"110\">🎮 PlayStation 5 Game – Life is Strange: Double Exposure | €32,99</h2>\r\n<p data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"448\"><strong data-start=\"112\" data-end=\"153\">Life is Strange: Double Exposure</strong> is het nieuwste deel in de geliefde Life is Strange-serie en brengt een diepgaand, emotioneel verhaal vol mysterie en keuzes. Beleef een nieuw avontuur met sterke personages en een meeslepende sfeer, speciaal geoptimaliseerd voor de <strong data-start=\"387\" data-end=\"404\">PlayStation 5</strong>. De game is getest en <strong data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"447\">direct speelbaar</strong>.</p>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"450\" data-end=\"467\">Specificaties</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n<li data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"499\">\r\n<p data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"499\"><strong data-start=\"470\" data-end=\"483\">Platform:</strong> PlayStation 5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"546\">\r\n<p data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"546\"><strong data-start=\"502\" data-end=\"511\">Game:</strong> Life is Strange: Double Exposure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"547\" data-end=\"588\">\r\n<p data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"588\"><strong data-start=\"549\" data-end=\"559\">Genre:</strong> Avontuur / Verhaalgedreven</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"589\" data-end=\"620\">\r\n<p data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"620\"><strong data-start=\"591\" data-end=\"605\">Spelmodus:</strong> Singleplayer</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"621\" data-end=\"653\">\r\n<p data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"653\"><strong data-start=\"623\" data-end=\"636\">Toestand:</strong> Gebruikt, getest</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"668\">Voordelen</h3>\r\n<ul data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<li data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"700\">\r\n<p data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"700\">Nieuw en meeslepend verhaal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"701\" data-end=\"750\">\r\n<p data-start=\"703\" data-end=\"750\">Keemuzes beïnvloeden het verloop van het spel</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"795\">\r\n<p data-start=\"753\" data-end=\"795\">Sterke personages en emotionele diepgang</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"796\" data-end=\"835\">\r\n<p data-start=\"798\" data-end=\"835\">Mooie graphics en prestaties op PS5</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"863\">\r\n<p data-start=\"838\" data-end=\"863\">Direct klaar om te spelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"874\">Prijs</h3>\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"886\"><strong data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"886\">€ 32,99</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1282\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"> </p>",
